OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 7 FEB
OL,4,G0630FBreakfast
OL,5,     GHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,6,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,7,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,8,G0900FSaturday Morning
OL,9,     GTom Service talks to conductor
OL,10,     GCristian Macelaru, composer Dai
OL,11,     GFujikura, and as Artemis II
OL,12,     Gprepares to launch, he looks at
OL,13,     Gthe music that has been taken to
OL,14,     Gthe moon.
OL,15,G1200FEarlier... with Jools Holland
OL,16,     GJools is joined by musician and
OL,17,     Gbandleader David Hermlin.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
